  "source_correspondence": [
    "Vasy wave Proposition 6.2 retains the sharp s+1 forcing threshold, large epsilon then small delta, and common-neighborhood bootstrap.",
    "Its weak Neumann proof uses actual H1 test functions and the natural antidual, not strong conormal preservation by localized inputs.",
